By the isochoric ratio bridge, between any two recorded states
"'$P_2/P_1 = T_2/T_1$; eliminating via $'"\\beta_0 = (1/P_0)(\\Delta P/\\Delta T)"'$
and the Eq.-(1) proportionality of $P$ to $T$ at fixed $n, V$ collapses
the finite-difference quotient to $P_0/T_0$, hence
